For each vertex pair $u_i$, $u_{i'}$ with $u_i \in U_j$ and $u_{i'}
\in U_{j'}$ such that $u_i$ and $u_{i'}$ are adjacent in~$H$, we create an edge between $v_{(i, j')}$ and $v_{(i', j)}$ in $G_3$.
Furthermore, create the edge~$\{w_j,w_{j+h/2}\}$ for each $1 \le j \le h/2$. 
