1317:\begin{theorem}
1318:\label{thm:matching}
1319:\MatchML can be solved in polynomial time if~$\ell\le2$.
1320:It is \NP-hard and \W{1}-hard when parameterized by the number of vertices to select~$k$ for all~$\ell\ge3$ and total numbers of layers~$t\ge\ell$.
1321:\end{theorem}
