1522:\emph{Correctness.}\quad  It remains to show that graph~$H$ has a clique that contains each color exactly once if and
1523: only if there is a vertex set~$X\subseteq V$ with $|X|\geq k$ such that
1524: graph~$G_z[X]$ contains a perfect matching for each~$1 \le z \le 3$.
1525: 
1526: $(\Rightarrow)$: 
1527: Assume that graph~$H$ has a clique
1528: $K:=\{u_1,u_2,\dots,u_h\}$ and, without loss of generality, $u_i \in U_i$ for
