1546: graph~$G_z[X]$ contains a perfect matching for each~$1 \le z \le 3$.
1547: First, consider the graph $G_1 \cup G_2$ and some pair of vertices~$\{x_1, x_2\} \subseteq X$ that is matched in~$G_1$ or in~$G_2$.
