\in U_j$ and $u_{i'} \in U_{j'}$.  We create a complete graph on the vertices in
$V_f \cup \{v_{(i, j')}, v_{(i', j)}\}$. Note that this complete graph has order
$c+1$ and hence is a $c$-regular graph. Furthermore, we create a complete graph
on all vertices in $W$. 

