codex
The first full self-test passes, but it exposed an important hardness issue: the shipping exact attack hit one million nodes in only about 0.28 seconds. That is not persuasive Track A evidence. I’m stress-testing a much larger cap and the next preset now; if the easy rung completes in a few seconds, I’ll move shipping upward instead of hiding behind a small cutoff.
