codex
The first oracle call remains live after roughly two minutes. The harness has a hard total deadline and will redraw provider errors rather than count them as failures, so I’m letting the script preserve an honest result instead of interrupting it.
codex
At hard, Gemini found a valid witness while the first Terra attempt failed. Because a level holds only if all three fail, hard cannot ship as-is if the remaining attempt also shows any success; the harness will use fixed-answer-length escalation by enlarging only the residue ground set.
