The stress run is slower than useful because it repeats a quadratic-size canonical invariant over many `n=600` instances. The required 60 invariance checks and 20 distinctness checks already passed in the final report; if this overtest does not finish on the next poll, I’ll stop it and run a focused interface audit that avoids redundant large-key work.
